diagnosis_text:
Affected component: the HTTPS service on the web1 application server (Apache on web_server_1) is not running/listening. Mechanism: modern browsers commonly try HTTPS first (HTTPS-First/HSTS policies). Because web1.local does not accept connections on TCP/443, the browser’s initial attempt stalls/fails, presenting as a page “timing out,” even though plain HTTP on port 80 is healthy.

